$task_contents[2] = <<<'HTML'
<div class="content-block">
    <h2>What Makes a Requirement True</h2>

    <p>A security requirement describes what must be true. A security control is the mechanism that makes it true. These are two different things described in two different documents, and confusing them is one of the most common mistakes a new security engineer makes.</p>

    <p>Think of a building code that requires every exit to be reachable within a certain distance. The requirement is the rule itself. The fire door installed at the end of the hallway is the control. The inspector checking that the door swings open freely is verifying the evidence. All three exist, and all three are different documents serving different purposes.</p>

